            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "TastyMint3803"
            },
            "reviewBody": "When shaking the bottle with hot water I used an old glass bottle that had a lid like a mason jar. I heated up the water in a cup before hand in the microwave then poured it into the mason jar. There is no need to boil the water super hot since it will be a cold drink and it’s dissolvable coffee. Then I just followed instructions and added flavored syrup and got some whip cream, yum!",
            "datePublished": "2025-05-01T12:56:05.842Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
