            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Rachel Loewen"
            },
            "reviewBody": "It was actually pretty good. The foam rose to the top and it was kind of bitter so I mixed it together.\nI also added a bit of vanilla, which gave it a nice flavor. \n9.2/10 Would recommend",
            "datePublished": "2021-01-24T23:32:05.010Z"
