            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Elizabeth"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Was really good and easy! We used Nescafe classico coffee. I mix up a bunch of this (without the milk) then store in a sealed jar in fridge for easy preparation in the morning.",
