              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "FriskySoy2546"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this for myself since I was craving iced coffee for some reason, I thought itd be hard considering I'm not exactly stocked with barista supplies but I had everything the recipe told me I needed(obviously since those are basic ingredients for coffee) and for my first time not only making it but ever trying it id say it's really good. This might be my personal preference but I'd add a bit more sugar. I also added some vanilla extract and Nutella because I have a sweet tooth, so I'll definitely be using this recipe again !",
            "datePublished": "2024-08-13T17:20:27.315Z"
          },
